        "original_id": "c41b9023-090a-5dc0-9009-89d5d0c5e6bf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendrick Lamar, DJ Dahi, Drake, Jay Rock\n- Products: “Section.80”, “Good Kid, M.A.A.D City”, “Money Trees”, “Worst Behavior”\n- Roles: American hip hop recording artist, American rapper, Canadian rapper, producer\n- Topics: album releases, song production, featured artists\n\nFacts:\n- Kendrick Lamar released his debut studio album “Section.80” in 2011 exclusively through the iTunes Store as an independent album.\n- Kendrick Lamar released “Good Kid, M.A.A.D City” in 2012 as his second studio album and major label debut.\n- “Money Trees” is a song by Kendrick Lamar taken from his 2012 album “Good Kid, M.A.A.D City.”\n- Jay Rock appears as a featured artist on Kendrick Lamar’s song “Money Trees.”\n- DJ Dahi is noted for producing Kendrick Lamar’s “Money Trees” and Drake’s “Worst Behavior.”",
